@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title 5.9  AOG / ROA / Critical Priority Handling (QP.56)
actor "Customer / CPU\n(CAO)" as Customer
participant "Mgr PC /\nCsE" as MPC
participant "CoE PCD /\nUnit PCD" as PCD
database "COL\n(Company Online)" as COL
participant "Repair route\n(CoE/OV/POOLEX/AW)" as REP
participant "Central /\nUnit Logistic" as LOG

Customer -> MPC : Upgrade component status to AOG / ROA / Critical
note right of MPC : via correspondence, meeting,\ntelephone, CAO
MPC -> COL : Identify item (P/N, desc, serial);\ninsert AOG/ROA column — status, qty, date
MPC -> PCD : Hasten recovery/repair by shortest process
alt Critical — suffix 'K'
  PCD -> PCD : HOB identify repair location; upgrade repair priority
end
PCD -> REP : Route: CoE/Unit repair, OV, POOLEX, or AW spares
REP --> PCD : Hasten repair; report progress & EDD
PCD -> MPC : Inform progress & estimation
MPC -> Customer : Advise CAO/CPU on EDD & delivery
alt Serviceable
  PCD -> COL : Stamp AOG/ROA on F111; update status
  PCD -> LOG : Proceed immediate delivery (temporary F218) per QP.51
  LOG -> Customer : Deliver component; relay DN ref & actual date
  MPC -> COL : On confirmation — AOG/ROA column = 'closed' + date
end
@enduml
